    "detailed_description": "<strong>Welcome to Zombie Restaurant!</strong><br><br>Prepare delicious meals with ingredients that fall from the sky to feed hordes of hungry zombies before their appetite turns to us.<br><br>In a world devastated by a zombie epidemic, not all the undead are bad\u2014most of them are just hungry. In Zombie Restaurant, you are the chef of a peculiar restaurant that caters to a very special clientele: zombies! From juicy burgers to tacos, you\u2019ll be serving up all kinds of delicious dishes.<br><br><br><strong>Help Us Improve!</strong><br><br>Your feedback is essential to make Zombie Restaurant the best game it can be. We\u2019d love to hear your ideas and comments! At the end of each session, you\u2019ll find a direct link to a quick survey. Tell us what you think and how we can improve!<br><br><strong>Add Zombie Restaurant to your wishlist</strong> and be the first to know when updates and additional content are released. Join our player community and help shape the future of Zombie Restaurant!",
